graph LR
    %% Outcome::of: what a failed lookup means
    fail[Lookup failed] --> what{What did GitHub say?}
    what -- App not installed --> closed[Domain closed]
    what -- repository not shown --> closed
    what -- anything else --> learn[Failure to learn]
    learn --> window[Stale snapshot inside the window]
    closed --> owner[Only machine owner and instance admins]
    closed --> retry[Ask again every 5 min]
    retry -.-> what
    learn --> degraded[degraded_since is set]
